    `name` IS "Kit", `date of birth` IS `the date` 2012 3 10, `parents or guardians` IS LIST "Ana"
    `became resident in the State on` IS JUST (`the date` 2012 3 10), `convictions` IS EMPTY
    `is a veterinarian` IS FALSE, `is a veterinary nurse` IS FALSE
    `units of competency completed` IS EMPTY, `courses completed` IS EMPTY
    `is an approved cat breeder` IS FALSE, `is an eligible pensioner` IS FALSE

