`a Dog Act conviction` MEANS `Conviction` WITH `an offence against` IS `the Dog Act 1976`, `convicted on` IS `the date` 2026 2 1
`an AWA conviction` MEANS `Conviction` WITH `an offence against` IS `the Animal Welfare Act 2002`, `convicted on` IS `the date` 2026 4 1
