    `keeps, or has agreed to keep, records about the cat and its owner` IS TRUE

GIVEN who IS A `Person`, d IS A `Calendar date`
GIVETH AN `Implant`
`a compliant chip implanted by` who `on` d MEANS `Implant` WITH
    `device complies with AS 5018-2001 and AS 5019-2001` IS TRUE
    `device is capable of being implanted in a cat` IS TRUE
    `device is designed to record information that can be electronically retrieved` IS TRUE
    `implanted by` IS who
    `implanted on` IS d

GIVEN who IS A `Person`, d IS A `Calendar date`
GIVETH A `Sterilisation`
`a desexing by` who `on` d MEANS `Sterilisation` WITH
    `made permanently infertile` IS TRUE, `by a surgical procedure` IS TRUE
    `performed by` IS who, `performed on` IS d

GIVEN lg IS A STRING, n IS A STRING, p IS A `Period of registration`, e IS A `Calendar date`
GIVETH A `Registration`
`a registration with` lg `in the name of` n `for` p `from` e MEANS `Registration` WITH
    `with local government` IS lg, `in the name of` IS n, `registration number` IS "R-1"
    `registered for` IS p, `has effect from` IS e, `cancelled on` IS NOTHING, `recorded in the register` IS TRUE

-- A cat with everything a case varies as an argument.
GIVEN n IS A STRING
      born IS A `Calendar date`
      ks IS A LIST OF `Keeper`
      district IS A STRING
      rs IS A LIST OF `Registration`
      imp IS A MAYBE `Implant`
      co IS A MAYBE `Database company`
      st IS A MAYBE `Sterilisation`
      custody IS A `Body`
GIVETH A `Cat`
`the cat` n born ks district rs imp co st custody MEANS `Cat` WITH
    `cat name`                                               IS n
    `is an animal of the species felis catus or a hybrid of that species` IS TRUE
    `born on`                                                IS born
    `keepers`                                                IS ks
    `ordinarily kept in the district of`                     IS district
    `is kept in the State`                                   IS TRUE
    `has died`                                               IS FALSE
    `registrations`                                          IS rs
    `implant`                                                IS imp
    `microchip database company`                             IS co
    `name recorded as owner in a microchip database`         IS NOTHING
    `there is evidence to the contrary of that record`       IS FALSE
    `sterilisation`                                          IS st
    `has a sterilisation tattoo on its ear`                  IS FALSE
    `microchipping health certificate`                       IS NOTHING
    `sterilisation health certificate`                       IS NOTHING
    `is owned for the purpose of breeding`                   IS FALSE
    `in the custody of`                                      IS custody
    `foster care`                                            IS NOTHING

`kept by Ana since 2025` MEANS LIST `an individual` `Ana` (`the date` 2025 1 1)
`chipped by Dr Vu` MEANS JUST (`a compliant chip implanted by` `Dr Vu` `on` (`the date` 2020 12 1))
`desexed by Dr Vu` MEANS JUST (`a desexing by` `Dr Vu` `on` (`the date` 2020 12 1))
`registered to Ana for life` MEANS LIST `a registration with` "City of Perth" `in the name of` "Ana" `for` `the life of the cat` `from` (`the date` 2025 3 1)

GIVEN who IS A `Person`, c IS A `Cat`, k IS A `Kind of application`, made IS A `Calendar date`, p IS A `Period of registration`, paid IS A NUMBER, decided IS A `Calendar date`
GIVETH AN `Application`
`an application by` who c k made p paid decided MEANS `Application` WITH
    `applicant` IS who, `for the cat` IS c, `kind of application` IS k
    `application made on` IS made, `made to the local government of` IS "City of Perth"
    `period applied for` IS p
    `details supplied from Form 1` IS LIST `Part A`, `Part B`, `Part D`, `Part F`, `Part G`
    `fee paid` IS paid, `fee as reduced or waived by the local government` IS NOTHING
    `requirement for information` IS NOTHING, `determined on` IS decided

GIVEN c IS A `Cat`, k IS A `Kind of transfer`, d IS A `Calendar date`, from IS A STRING, to IS A MAYBE STRING, recipient IS A `Body`, voucher IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Transfer`
`a transfer of` c k d from to recipient voucher MEANS `Transfer` WITH
    `the cat transferred` IS c, `kind` IS k, `made on` IS d
    `the person parting with the cat` IS from, `the person receiving the cat` IS to, `the recipient is` IS recipient
    `transferor is satisfied that a s 14(2) certificate applies` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that a s 18(2)(a) certificate applies` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that the purchaser is an approved cat breeder purchasing the cat for the purpose of breeding` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that the cat belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from sterilisation` IS FALSE
    `a voucher is given to the purchaser to have the cat sterilised later by a veterinarian at no cost to the purchaser` IS voucher

GIVEN d IS A `Calendar date`, public IS A BOOLEAN, tag IS A BOOLEAN, shown IS A MAYBE `Show holder`
GIVETH AN `Outing`
`an outing on` d public tag shown MEANS `Outing` WITH
    `outing date` IS d
    `the cat is in a place to which the public has lawful access` IS public
    `the cat is wearing its registration tag` IS tag
    `the cat is being exhibited for show purposes at a cat show held by` IS shown
    `the contravention was due to the act or default of another person, an accident, or some other cause beyond the accused's control` IS FALSE
    `the accused took reasonable precautions and could not by the exercise of due diligence have prevented the commission of the offence` IS FALSE

§ `D-01 -- after a transfer the registered owner remains the owner`

-- Tess, chipped, desexed and registered to Ana for life from 1 March 2025. Ana sells her to Ben
-- on 18 December 2026 and Ben has kept and cared for her since.
`Tess, sold to Ben` MEANS `the cat` "Tess" (`the date` 2020 6 1) (LIST `an individual` `Ben` (`the date` 2026 12 18)) "City of Perth" `registered to Ana for life` `chipped by Dr Vu` (JUST `Petsafe`) `desexed by Dr Vu` (`anyone else` "Ben")

#ASSERT `s 4 -- the owners of` `Tess, sold to Ben` `on` (`the date` 2027 6 1) EQUALS LIST "Ana"
#ASSERT NOT `the person` `Ben` `is an owner of` `Tess, sold to Ben` `on` (`the date` 2027 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `s 8(1) -- the applicant may apply` (`an application by` `Ben` `Tess, sold to Ben` `for the grant of registration` (`the date` 2027 6 1) `one year` 10 (`the date` 2027 6 3))
#ASSERT `s 6(1) --` `Ana` `contravenes the subsection for` `Tess, sold to Ben` `on` (`an outing on` (`the date` 2027 6 1) TRUE FALSE NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `s 6(1) --` `Ben` `contravenes the subsection for` `Tess, sold to Ben` `on` (`an outing on` (`the date` 2027 6 1) TRUE FALSE NOTHING)

