§ `U-04, U-06, R-17 -- a child keeper and her parent`

-- Mo is kept by Kit, a child, from 1 March 2026; Ana is Kit's parent.
`Mo` MEANS `the cat` "Mo" (`the date` 2020 6 1) (LIST `an individual` `Kit` (`the date` 2026 3 1)) "City of Perth" EMPTY `chipped by Dr Vu` (JUST `Petsafe`) `desexed by Dr Vu` (`anyone else` "Kit")

#ASSERT `s 4 -- the owners of` `Mo` `on` (`the date` 2026 10 1) EQUALS LIST "Kit", "Ana"
#ASSERT `s 4, reading B -- the owners of` `Mo` `on` (`the date` 2026 10 1) EQUALS LIST "Ana"
-- U-06 (FORK-03): reading A puts Ana within s 5(1) on 20 March; reading B never.
#ASSERT `s 5(1) --` `Ana` `contravenes the subsection for` `Mo` `on` (`the date` 2026 3 20)
#ASSERT `s 5(2)(a), reading B of FORK-03 -- the cat` `Mo` `has been kept by` `Ana` `for less than 14 days on` (`the date` 2027 3 20)
-- R-17: Kit's application must be refused (s 9(2)(a)), and both Kit and Ana are "the owner".
#ASSERT `s 9 -- the decision required on` (`an application by` `Kit` `Mo` `for the grant of registration` (`the date` 2026 11 15) `one year` 20 (`the date` 2026 11 20)) EQUALS `must refuse`
#ASSERT `s 13(2) -- notice must be given of` `refuse to grant or renew the registration under s 9`

