§ `R-24 -- s 19 and a certificate not given under s 21`

`Tom` MEANS `the cat` "Tom" (`the date` 2026 1 1) `kept by Ana since 2025` "City of Perth" EMPTY NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (`anyone else` "Ana")
