§ `D-31, R-32, L-33 -- s 24 notices`

`Tess, renewed` MEANS `the cat` "Tess" (`the date` 2020 6 1) `kept by Ana since 2025` "City of Perth" (LIST `a registration with` "City of Perth" `in the name of` "Ana" `for` `one year` `from` (`the date` 2026 11 1)) `chipped by Dr Vu` (JUST `Petsafe`) `desexed by Dr Vu` (`anyone else` "Ana")

GIVEN to IS A STRING, d IS A `Calendar date`
GIVETH A `Notice`
`a notice naming the purchaser to` to `on` d MEANS `Notice` WITH
    `given on` IS d, `in writing` IS TRUE, `given to` IS to
    `items` IS LIST `the cat owner's full name`, `the cat owner's residential address`

`Ana offers Tess for sale` MEANS `a transfer of` `Tess, renewed` `offer for sale` (`the date` 2026 12 18) "Ana" NOTHING (`anyone else` "the public") FALSE
#ASSERT `s 24(a) -- notice to a local government is required for` `Ana offers Tess for sale`
#ASSERT NOT `s 24 -- there is a purchaser to name in` `Ana offers Tess for sale`
#ASSERT `s 24 -- the seller in` `Ana offers Tess for sale` `contravenes the section, having given` (LIST `a notice naming the purchaser to` "City of Perth" `on` (`the date` 2026 12 21), `a notice naming the purchaser to` "PetBase Pty Ltd, trading as Petsafe" `on` (`the date` 2026 12 21)) `, on` (`the date` 2026 12 30) `given the holidays` `the holidays`

-- R-32: an unregistered cat with no company: neither paragraph has an addressee.
#ASSERT NOT `s 24(a) -- notice to a local government is required for` (`a transfer of` `Tom` `give away` (`the date` 2026 10 1) "Ana" (JUST "Ben") (`anyone else` "Ben") TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 24(b) -- notice to a microchip database company is required for` (`a transfer of` `Tom` `give away` (`the date` 2026 10 1) "Ana" (JUST "Ben") (`anyone else` "Ben") TRUE)

-- L-33: Ana sells the renewed Tess to Ben on 18 December 2026. She owes the s 24 notice as
-- seller, and -- still the registered owner, so still "the owner" -- s 25 notices of the same
-- change of "the cat owner's full name". Ben owes neither.
`Tess, renewed and sold` MEANS `the cat` "Tess" (`the date` 2020 6 1) (LIST `an individual` `Ben` (`the date` 2026 12 18)) "City of Perth" (LIST `a registration with` "City of Perth" `in the name of` "Ana" `for` `one year` `from` (`the date` 2026 11 1)) `chipped by Dr Vu` (JUST `Petsafe`) `desexed by Dr Vu` (`anyone else` "Ben")
#ASSERT `s 24(a) -- notice to a local government is required for` (`a transfer of` `Tess, renewed and sold` `sell` (`the date` 2026 12 18) "Ana" (JUST "Ben") (`anyone else` "Ben") FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 25(a) -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed and sold` `on a change to` `the cat owner's full name` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
#ASSERT `s 25(b) -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed and sold` `on a change to` `the cat owner's full name` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
#ASSERT NOT `s 25(a) -- the duty applies to` `Ben` `for` `Tess, renewed and sold` `on a change to` `the cat owner's full name` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)

