#ASSERT `r 12(2)(a)(ii) -- 31 October in the final year of the 3-year period beginning on` (`the date` 2026 11 1) EQUALS `the date` 2029 10 31
#ASSERT `r 12(2)(a)(ii) -- 31 October of the calendar year the period ends, reading B` (`the date` 2026 3 1) EQUALS `the date` 2029 10 31
#ASSERT `r 12(2)(a)(ii) -- the third 31 October after, reading C` (`the date` 2026 10 31) EQUALS `the date` 2029 10 31
