#ASSERT NOT `r 12(2)(b) -- a renewal made on` (`the date` 2026 10 10) `may take effect from 1 November` 2026
#ASSERT `r 12(2)(b) -- a renewal made on` (`the date` 2026 10 11) `may take effect from 1 November` 2026
