#ASSERT `Sch 3 item 1(a) -- made after 31 May, reading B` (`the date` 2026 11 15)
-- T-46: a one-year registration granted on 25 October 2026 ends six days later, for $10.
#ASSERT `r 12(2)(a)(i) -- the next 31 October after` (`the date` 2026 10 25) EQUALS `the date` 2026 10 31
